# Store and check out text files with LF endings on every platform.
#
# Without this, a Windows checkout gives shell scripts and workflow `run:`
# blocks CRLF endings, which fail with "\r: command not found" when they run
# under bash — locally in Git Bash and on the Linux runners in CI.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary files git should never touch.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.db binary
